        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, no. I’m like Christopher in this respect; I don’t have favourites. There are certainly some heroes that I prefer over others, but I can’t pick <em>just one</em> (or three) that are better than <em>all the rest.</em></p>\n<p>No love for Visionary, Naturalist, or Mainstay? They each have only a single vote at present. : (</p>",
